# Agent Guide

## Read First

Before project work, read:

1. `docs/README.md`
2. The relevant spec or decision linked from `docs/README.md`

Use this file as a table of contents, not as a full instruction manual. Durable project knowledge should live in `docs/`.

Before scaffolding a new backend, frontend, feature slice, or validation gate, use `docs/tasks/scaffold-planning.md` to record layer direction, DTO/source-of-truth strategy, and checks that can be added now versus later.

